  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1083.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>154 fotos de la iniciativa Endavant Onda en el partido Villarreal-Alav&eacute;s (0-2) de este domingo, 27 de noviembre,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_0670.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>con cl&iacute;nic previo a cargo de Marcos Senna en la Serratella, el lunes 21.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1040.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En las inmediaciones del Madrigal, stand y roc&oacute;dromo de Sargantana Aventura,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1110.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>y en el interior del campo, pasacalle doble de la banda de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda (UMSCO).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/endavantondamarcossennavillarrealalaves/img_0639.jpg\" alt=\"img_0639\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/endavantondamarcossennavillarrealalaves/img_0640.jpg\" alt=\"img_0640\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/endavantondamarcossennavillarrealalaves/img_0641.jpg\" alt=\"img_0641\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/endavantondamarcossennavillarrealalaves/img_0642.jpg\" alt=\"img_0642\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/endavantondamarcossennavillarrealalaves/img_0643.jpg\" alt=\"img_0643\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"ht